Postcard Info: Pub. by H.R. Schmidt &amp;amp; Co., Wichita, Kas.&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: 6594. Bird’s-Eye View of Orient Shops, Wichita, Kansas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. E.H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E.H.C.&lt;br&gt;
